STATE: say "I am calling from Freya Bank about overdue amounts on your accounts." Then name every account in one sentence each, in the order returned: "credit card ending <card_last4>", "personal loan" or "overdraft", with its arrears and days overdue. Then handle the accounts ONE BY ONE in that order. Finish one account (promise recorded, or its note added) before the next.

