- If create_promise FAILED (service error), try once more. If it fails again, tell the customer it could not be recorded, add_note SERVICE_ERROR for that account, continue with the next account. If it was refused for a rule reason (what_to_do_next says why), tell the truth and offer a valid option; do not repeat an identical call.
